# All corpus/cache/dataset content under data/ stays local-only, EXCEPT the
# dataset-builder CODE (build_*.py + helpers), which the runtime council heads
# pin their label vocabularies to (training-pipeline code, not data). Use data/*
# (not data/) so git descends to honor the !-allow re-includes below.
SemantiK/data/*
!SemantiK/data/builders/
!SemantiK/data/builders/*.py
!SemantiK/data/augmentation/
!SemantiK/data/augmentation/*.py
!SemantiK/data/alignment/
!SemantiK/data/alignment/*.py
!SemantiK/data/sources/
!SemantiK/data/sources/*.py
!SemantiK/data/common/
!SemantiK/data/common/*.py
# Phase-0 global aligner module + its unit tests are training-pipeline CODE
# (not data) — track them. The data/tests/ dir is re-included so git descends
# (dataset OUTPUT dirs stay ignored; __pycache__ stays ignored via global rules).
# Realistic-rendering presentation augmenter — training-pipeline CODE (the
# build pins its render profiles), not data. Track it + its unit tests.
# Exact render-time element->bbox role labeler — training-pipeline CODE.
!SemantiK/data/tests/
!SemantiK/data/tests/test_structure_align.py
!SemantiK/data/tests/test_render_augment.py
# extension belt-and-suspenders (model artifact zoo)
SemantiK/**/*.gguf
SemantiK/**/*.pt
SemantiK/**/*.pth
