# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Training-data DOWNLOAD / corpus-fetch / training-pair-generation scripts.
# Migration policy: only inference/cascade pipeline CODE ships. Scripts that
# fetch corpora over the network or generate training-data pairs are part of
# the local data-acquisition surface (alongside models/ + data/) and never
# land on GitHub. Inference/codegen scripts (e.g. gen_wcag_coverage_doc.py,
# infer_pdf.py, run_cascade_json.py) stay tracked.
SemantiK/scripts/fetch_*.py
SemantiK/scripts/crawl_*.py
SemantiK/scripts/pair_from_*.py
SemantiK/scripts/gen_synthetic_forms.py
SemantiK/scripts/mine_figure_labels.py

# SemantiK internal dev-planning docs (stale machine paths, not product)
SemantiK/Plans/

